+// GDN decode conv + gated-delta step as one dispatch (Qwen3.8-2B geometry:
+// head dim 128, key heads == value heads, bf16, T == 1, B == 1). Equivalent,
+// bit for bit, to gdn_conv_update(activate, qk norm) -> split -> reshape ->
+// gated_delta_update_raw, which is exactly what the fallback composes.
+// Returns {delta output [B, 1, Hv, Dv], recurrent state [B, Hv, Dv, Dk],
+// conv carry-out state [B, K-1, C]}. `key_dim` is Hk * 128; the value width
+// is C - 2 * key_dim.
